      "writtenOn": "2025-09-29T18:01:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Are we going to allow embedders to swap decoders at runtime?\n\nRuntime swap is not needed by Chromium.  So, for simplicity, I would lean toward supporting only built-time selection/swap.\n\n\u003e Just eyeballing, but this is a compile-time swap. It\u0027s probably ok, given how libpng is used.\n\nAck.  Thanks for looking.",
      "parentUuid": "d2030ae2_efd92c59",
